/* Lottery number picker! - Original concept by Mark Pegler */
/* Converted to Zeus Professional by Ian Forest */

Options Results
Parse Arg Line

ChkCarrier
if RC ~= 0 then exit

ClrScr FORCE
Display 'Doors:NatLottery/Top'

call randu(time('s'))
Ao:
A = Random(1,49)
Write A'"  "'
Delay(20)
Bo:
Ba = Random(1,49)
If Ba=A then call Bo
Write Ba'"  "'
Delay(20)
Co:
C = Random(1,49)
If C=A then call Co
If C=Ba then call Co
Write C'"  "'
Delay(20)
Do:
D = Random(1,49)
If D=A then call Do
If D=Ba then call Do
If D=C then call Do
Write D'"  "'
Delay(20)
Eo:
E = Random(1,49)
If E=A then call Eo
If E=Ba then call Eo
If E=C then call Eo
If E=D then call Eo
Write E'"  "'
Delay(20)
Fo:
F = Random(1,49)
If F=A then call Fo
if F=Ba then call Fo
If F=C then call Fo
If F=D then call Fo
If F=E then call Fo
Write F'"  "'
Delay(20)
Display 'doors:NatLottery/Bottom' NoReset

Write '"\n\n"'
WaitReturn
Exit
